sysctlnametomib with too little room: ENOMEM
sysctlnametomib of an unknown name: ENOENT
by the numbers from sysctlnametomib, the same answer: yes
CTL_KERN.KERN_OSRELEASE is kern.osrelease: yes
CTL_HW.HW_MEMSIZE is hw.memsize: yes
unknown number: ENOENT
