proc_pidpath is _NSGetExecutablePath, links resolved: yes
proc_pidpath with a small buffer: 0, EINVAL
proc_pidpath of the parent: found
proc_name is the program's name: yes
host_page_size matches getpagesize: yes
host_statistics64: ok, count 38, pages within hw.memsize: yes
